<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: knocked out -->
  <AM_KnockedOut.label>被擊倒</AM_KnockedOut.label>
  <!-- EN: The result of being knocked out during melee combat.\nRecovery will happen automatically over time, or it can be cured by another pawn, even without medicine. -->
  <AM_KnockedOut.description>此單位在近戰時被擊倒了。\n擊倒狀態可通過被他人救助（等同於治療傷口疾病，但完全可以不用醫藥）來立即解除。當此狀態的持續時間結束後，被擊倒的單位也會自行起身。</AM_KnockedOut.description>
  <!-- EN: being knocked out -->
  <AM_KnockedOut.labelNoun>被擊倒</AM_KnockedOut.labelNoun>
  
</LanguageData>